<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0.5in 0pt 0; text-align: justify">Emerging growth company <span style="font-family: Wingdings"><span style="font-family: Wingdings"><span id="xdx_90F_edei--EntityEmergingGrowthCompany_c20250401__20250401_zINk1XgtAPs3"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="AsOf2025-04-01" format="ixt:booleanfalse" id="Fact000029" name="dei:EntityEmergingGrowthCompany">&#168;</ix:nonNumeric></span></span></span></p>

